msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#: warehouse/templates/accounts/two-factor.html:115
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<p> Generate a code using the authentication application connected to your "
"PyPI account. Enter this code in the form to verify your identity. </p> <p> "
"Lost your application? Not working? <a href=\"%(href)s\">Get help</a>. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> ສ້າງລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບບັນຊີ PyPI ຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ປ້ອນລະຫັດນີ້ໃນແບບຟອມເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງທ່ານ. </p> <p> ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເສຍບໍ? ໃຊ້ວຽກບໍ່ໄດ້ບໍ? <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">ຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ</a>. </p>"

#: warehouse/templates/accounts/two-factor.html:130
msgid "Lost your security key or application?"
msgstr "ຄີຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫຼື ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານເສຍບໍ?"

#: warehouse/templates/accounts/two-factor.html:134
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<p> <strong>You have not generated account recovery codes.</strong> </p> <p> "
"If you lose access to your two factor methods, you may lose access to your "
"account. <a href=\"%(href)s\">Get help with recovery codes.</a> </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> <strong>ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນບັນຊີ.</strong> </p> <p> "
