#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you are the owner of this token, you can delete it by going to your <a "
"href=\"%(href)s#api-tokens\">API tokens configuration</a> and deleting the "
"token named <strong>%(token_name)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂທເຄັນນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບມັນໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ <a href=\"%(href)s#api-"
"tokens\">ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂທເຄັນ API</a> ແລະ ລຶບໂທເຄັນທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ <strong>%(token_name)s</"
"strong>."

