msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:426
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:426
msgid ""
"No pending publishers are currently configured. Publishers for projects that "
"don't exist yet can be added below."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ທີ່ລໍຖ້າການສ້າງເທື່ອ. ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ສຳລັບໂຄງການທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີ ສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ຢູ່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:433
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:431
msgid "Add a new pending publisher"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ທີ່ລໍຖ້າການສ້າງໃໝ່"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:435
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:432
msgid "You can use this page to register \"pending\" trusted publishers."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໜ້ານີ້ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ແບບ \"ລໍຖ້າການສ້າງ (pending)\"."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:440
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:434
#, python-format
msgid ""
"These publishers behave similarly to trusted publishers registered against "
"specific projects, except that they allow users to <strong>create</strong> "
"the project if it doesn't already exist. Once the project is created, the "
"\"pending\" publisher becomes an ordinary trusted publisher. You can read "
"more about \"pending\" and ordinary trusted publishers <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກຄ້າຍຄືກັບຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ເຊິ່ງລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ກັບໂຄງການສະເພາະ, "
"ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ພວກເຂົາອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ <strong>ສ້າງ</strong> ໂຄງການໄດ້ຫາກມັນຍັງບໍ່ມີເທື່ອ. "
"ເມື່ອໂຄງການຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ \"pending\" ຈະກາຍເປັນຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ແບບທຳມະດາ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ແບບ \"pending\" ແລະ ແບບທຳມະດາ <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">ໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:450
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:444
msgid ""
"Configuring a \"pending\" publisher for a project name does <strong>not</"
"strong> reserve that name. Until the project is created, any other user may "
"create it, including via their own \"pending\" publisher."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ແບບ \"pending\" ສຳລັບຊື່ໂຄງການ <strong>ບໍ່ໄດ້</strong> "
"ເປັນການຈອງຊື່ນັ້ນໄວ້. ຈົນກວ່າໂຄງການຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນອາດຈະສ້າງມັນໄດ້, ລວມທັງຜ່ານຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ "
"\"pending\" ຂອງພວກເຂົາເອງ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:485
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:407
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You must first enable <a href=\"%(href)s\">two-factor authentication</a> on "
"your account before adding a new publisher."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ <a href=\"%(href)s\">ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສອງຊັ້ນ</a> ໃນບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນ "
"ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດເພີ່ມຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-burn.html:16
msgid ""
"In order to verify that you have safely stored your recovery codes for use "
"in the event of a lost 2FA device, submit one of your recovery codes here."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເກັບຮັກສາລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນໄວ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ອຸປະກອນ 2FA ເສຍ, "
"ໃຫ້ສົ່ງລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນອັນໜຶ່ງຂອງທ່ານທີ່ນີ້."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-burn.html:21
msgid ""
"The recovery code you choose will be considered used and no longer be "
"available to bypass 2FA."
msgstr "ລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຈະຖືວ່າຖືກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ເພື່ອຂ້າມ 2FA ໄດ້ອີກ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-burn.html:26
msgid ""
"<strong>Forgot to safely store your recovery codes?</strong> You'll need to "
"generate them again."
msgstr "<strong>ລືມເກັບຮັກສາລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນໄວ້ໃຫ້ປອດໄພບໍ?</strong> ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງພວກມັນໃໝ່."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:4
msgid "Account recovery codes"
msgstr "ລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນບັນຊີ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:20
msgid "Regenerate recovery codes"
msgstr "ສ້າງລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນໃໝ່"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:28
msgid ""
"If you lose access to your authentication application or security key(s), "
"you’ll need to use one of these recovery codes to log into your PyPI "
"account. Each code can only be used <strong>once</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານເສຍສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ຫຼື ກະແຈຄວາມປອດໄພ, "
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ບັນຊີ PyPI ຂອງທ່ານ. ແຕ່ລະລະຫັດສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງ "
"<strong>ຄັ້ງດຽວ</strong> ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:31
msgid ""
"These codes should <strong>only</strong> be used for account recovery, not "
"for typical logins."
msgstr ""
"ລະຫັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກໃຊ້ <strong>ສະເພາະ</strong> ເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນບັນຊີເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບທົ່ວໄປ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:34
msgid ""
"<strong>Keep these somewhere safe</strong>. If you lose your authentication "
"application or security key(s) and do not have access to these recovery "
"codes, you may permanently lose access to your PyPI account!"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເກັບຮັກສາລະຫັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ບ່ອນທີ່ປອດໄພ</strong>. ຫາກທ່ານເສຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ຫຼື "
"ກະແຈຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານອາດຈະເສຍສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ບັນຊີ PyPI "
"ຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງຖາວອນ!"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:38
msgid "Save your recovery codes"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນຂອງທ່ານ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/recovery_codes-provision.html:60
