"ໂທເຄັນ API ທີ່ມີຂອບເຂດທັງໝົດບັນຊີ ຈະມີສິດໃນການອັບໂຫຼດສຳລັບທຸກໂຄງການ ທັງໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ "
"ໃນອະນາຄົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:183
msgid "Create token"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂທເຄັນ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:4
msgid "Set up 2FA with an authentication application (TOTP)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ 2FA ດ້ວຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (TOTP)"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:17
#, python-format
msgid ""
"PyPI supports any application that follows the <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><abbr title=\"time-"
"based one-time password\">TOTP</abbr> standard</a>."
msgstr ""
"PyPI ຮອງຮັບທຸກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມ <a href=\"%(href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><abbr title=\"time-based one-time "
"password\">ມາດຕະຖານ TOTP</abbr></a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:21
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Visit <a href=\"%(href)s\">PyPI's help page</a> for a list of compatible "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າເບິ່ງ <a href=\"%(href)s\">ໜ້າຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ PyPI</a> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:26
msgid "Set up your application"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:28
msgid "Scan the QR code with the authentication application of your choice."
msgstr "ສະແກນລະຫັດ QR ດ້ວຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:29
msgid ""
"For security reasons, you can only associate one authentication application "
"per PyPI account."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຫດຜົນດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງບັນຊີ PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:35
msgid "QR code for setting up an authentication application"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ QR ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:40
msgid ""
"<strong>No QR scanner?</strong> Enter this code in your TOTP application "
"instead:"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງສະແກນ QR ບໍ?</strong> ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດນີ້ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ TOTP ຂອງທ່ານແທນ:"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:58
msgid "Verify application"
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:63
msgid "Authentication code"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:74
msgid ""
"To finalize the set-up process, enter the 6-digit code provided by your TOTP "
"application."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດ 6 ຫຼັກທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ TOTP ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:86
msgid "Set up application"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:4
msgid "Set up 2FA with a security device (e.g. USB key)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ 2FA ດ້ວຍອຸປະກອນຄວາມປອດໄພ (ເຊັ່ນ: ກະແຈ USB)"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"PyPI supports any device that adheres to the <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FIDO standard</a>."
msgstr ""
"PyPI ຮອງຮັບທຸກອຸປະກອນທີ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມ <a href=\"%(href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ມາດຕະຖານ FIDO</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Popular <em>USB keys</em> include <a href=\"%(yubico_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yubikey</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(titan_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Google Titan</a> and <a href=\"%(thetis_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Thetis</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>ກະແຈ USB</em> ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມນິຍົມລວມມີ <a href=\"%(yubico_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yubikey</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(titan_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Google Titan</a> ແລະ <a href=\"%(thetis_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Thetis</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:36
msgid "Name your device to begin"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:45
msgid "PyPI supports adding multiple security devices."
msgstr "PyPI ຮອງຮັບການເພີ່ມອຸປະກອນຄວາມປອດໄພຫຼາຍອັນ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:47
msgid ""
"Please give this device a name. 64 characters or fewer. All Unicode is "
"valid, including spaces."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາຕັ້ງຊື່ອຸປະກອນນີ້. ບໍ່ເກີນ 64 ຕົວອັກສອນ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ Unicode ໄດ້ທຸກຮູບແບບ ລວມທັງຍະຫວ່າງ."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:62
msgid "Set up security device"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອຸປະກອນຄວາມປອດໄພ"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:68
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Not working?</strong> Check you're using a device that follows the "
"<a href=\"%(fido_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">FIDO specification</a> and a <a href=\"%(mozilla_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">compatible browser</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້ບໍ?</strong> ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນທີ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມ <a "
"href=\"%(fido_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ FIDO</a> ແລະ <a href=\"%(mozilla_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ບຣາວເຊີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:79
msgid ""
"Note that some older USB keys do not adhere to the FIDO standard and will "
