msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບບັນຊີ PyPI ຂອງທ່ານ, ຈາກນັ້ນເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ໜ້າຂອງໂຄງການນັ້ນ. ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບຂ້າງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ "
"<strong>Report project as malware</strong>. ແລ້ວລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນແບບຟອມ:"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:37
msgid "A URL to the project in question"
msgstr "URL ຂອງໂຄງການດັ່ງກ່າວ"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:38
msgid "An explanation of what makes the project a security issue"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍວ່າເປັນຫຍັງໂຄງການນີ້ຈຶ່ງເປັນບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A link to the problematic lines in the project's distributions via <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">inspector.pypi.io</a>"
msgstr ""
"ລີ້ງໄປຫາແຖວທີ່ມີບັນຫາໃນການແຈກຢາຍຂອງໂຄງການຜ່ານ <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">inspector.pypi.io</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:44
msgid ""
"Valid malware reports may include examples of typo-squatting, dependency "
"confusion, data exfiltration, obfuscation, command/control, etc."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍງານມັລແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອາດລວມມີຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ typo-squatting, dependency confusion, "
"ການລັກຂໍ້ມູນ, ການອຳພາງໂຄດ, ການສັ່ງການ/ຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:46
msgid ""
"If you've identified a security issue with PyPI itself (not a project hosted "
"on PyPI)"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານພົບຫາບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພກັບຕົວ PyPI ເອງ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂຄງການທີ່ໂຮດຢູ່ໃນ PyPI)"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:48
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Email <a href=\"%(href)s\">security@pypi.org</a>, providing as much relevant "
"information as possible, including reproducing steps."
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອີເມວຫາ <a href=\"%(href)s\">security@pypi.org</a>, "
"ໂດຍລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃຫ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້, ລວມທັງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຊ້ຳ."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:50
msgid "What happens next?"
msgstr "ຈະເກີດຫຍັງຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ໄປ?"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:52
msgid ""
"Once you've submitted an issue via email, you should receive an "
"acknowledgment within 48 hours."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານສົ່ງບັນຫາຜ່ານອີເມວແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບຮັບພາຍໃນ 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:54
